          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="experience-card">
          <div class="experience-meta">
            <h3>Software Developer Intern, IBM ZCodeScan</h3>
            <span>Jan 2025 – Jul 2025</span>
          </div>
          <p>
            Contributed as part of a four-member product engineering team to add detection rules, validate static
            analysis workflows, and strengthen reliability across Java rules, unit tests, CLI options, and reporting.
            I also built extension prototypes and supported product discussions around future AI-assisted capabilities.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="experience-card">
          <div class="experience-meta">
            <h3>Software Development Engineer Intern, Amazon</h3>
            <span>May 2024 – Jul 2024</span>
